  "dataSourceInstructions": "Join keys: sites.site_id = devices.site_id = batteries.site_id = fin_contracts.site_id =\nfleet_alert_events.site_id; sites.customer_id = fin_contracts.customer_id = fin_customers.customer_id.\nCount alerts with COUNT(DISTINCT alert_id) and event_type = 'raised'; count alert events with COUNT(*).\nProduct values are capitalized ('Loan', 'Lease', 'PPA'); status values are capitalized ('Active', 'Delinquent', 'Default',\n'PaidOff'). Installed PV capacity comes from sites.pv_capacity_kw (not from fin_contracts). fieldops_visits.alert_id = fleet_alert_events.alert_id; fieldops_procedures.alert_code = fleet_alert_events.alert_code.",
